Dear Minako,

Please find attached the agreed wording for clause 6, FDT-202511-CL-001, vers=
ion 1.0. It reflects your written notice of completed reconciliation as the s=
tarting date, with the following day counted as day one of the 30 calendar da=
ys. The reporting scope includes the temporary area used for restore verifica=
tion, and any supplement is due within the same period.

We cannot set the actual reporting deadline until Toto gives that written not=
ice. Let us settle the transfer schedule and the recipient for the notice in =
the operational communications as the arrangements progress.

Best regards,
Catherine Simmons
